.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-draft 1  "draft " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-draft \- Open a draft in $EDITOR, importing it from a drafts maildir when its markdown doesn\*(Aqt exist yet
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc draft\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-editor\fR] [\fB\-\-compile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIINPUT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open a draft in $EDITOR, importing it from a drafts maildir when its markdown doesn\*(Aqt exist yet
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-editor\fR \fI<EDITOR>\fR
Editor name from [editors] (default: first configured, else $EDITOR)
.TP
\fB\-\-compile\fR
Compile the draft back to the drafts maildir after the editor closes
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIINPUT\fR]
Draft slug, path, or Message\-ID; omit to pick a draft interactively
